  "id": "adaptive-task-allocation",
  "term": "adaptive task allocation",
  "definition": "Adaptive task allocation is a way of dividing work flexibly between people and robots as conditions change. In the source, it refers to dynamic labor sharing within a human–robot system that can improve efficiency and reduce operator workload.",
